Z||000000||bullyt||12-21-2001||12:46 AM||||Hi guys,<BR>I'm trying to fix the speedo in my '84 4 cyl. with manual transmission. The previous owner told me it's the cruise control module that needs replacing. Does anyone know where in the car I would find this module? Also, how do I tell if that's what's really wrong?||||reg||5
Z||000001||fierohoho||12-21-2001||06:13 AM||||The '84 did not have a cruise control module, it works through the ECM, the later years did though.<P>The likely cause would be the sender at the tranny, either the nylon gear dropped off or the wires/connection may be bad.<P>Use the search function for further info, you may have to dig but the info is there.<P>One question for clarification, does the odometer work or is it out also?<P>Welcome to the forum, I'll watch this post for any other questions, HoHo.<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lightbar.gif"> ||||reg||1
